    "number": 119,
    "title": "Synchronize Pixoo Monitor and Media controls in the work guide",
    "body": "Companion to jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade#33 and source PR jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade#64.\n\nPrepares the guide narrative, pinned candidate sources and monitoring sequence for explicit Monitor/Media ownership, selected filters and the finite integration API. Source review/merge and issue closure remain pending; the candidate says so. Finalization will refresh authoritative backlogs/history and replace candidate pins with the verified source merge.\n\nLocal candidate validation passes generation, five maintenance tests, nine diagram validations and guide browser/print checks. The changed standalone monitoring viewer passes Archify automated browser checks and was visually inspected. Independent guide reviews and final revision checks remain pending.\n\nGuide-only source synchronization. No public publication, installation, client qualification or physical operation. The coordinator of Pixoo #33 owns this companion.\n",
    "state": "open",
